{
  "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><svg class=\"brand-mark\" viewBox=\"-1 -1 103 35\" width=\"103\" height=\"35\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g class=\"header-spark\"><path d=\"M13.9822 0L23.9694 4.49428L19.4751 14.4815L9.48789 9.98725L13.9822 0Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></g><path d=\"M0 15.4803H10.4866V22.4713H19.4751V15.4803H29.9618V32.9579H0V15.4803Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path transform=\"translate(32.409095 32.958) scale(0.033065 -0.033065)\" d=\"M77 740H205V306H211L286 388L413 516H562L357 313L584 0H431L266 240L205 182V0H77Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path transform=\"translate(50.348884999999996 32.958) scale(0.033065 -0.033065)\" d=\"M332 596Q287 596 268.5 615.0Q250 634 250 661V685Q250 712 268.5 731.0Q287 750 332 750Q377 750 395.5 731.0Q414 712 414 685V661Q414 634 395.5 615.0Q377 596 332 596ZM98 101H268V415H98V516H396V101H554V0H98Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path transform=\"translate(67.517515 32.958) scale(0.033065 -0.033065)\" d=\"M72 101H236V639H72V740H364V101H529V0H72Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path transform=\"translate(84.30952500000001 32.958) scale(0.033065 -0.033065)\" d=\"M75 0V516H203V425H208Q225 467 260.5 497.5Q296 528 359 528Q435 528 482.5 477.5Q530 427 530 333V0H402V315Q402 427 305 427Q285 427 267.0 422.0Q249 417 234.5 406.5Q220 396 211.5 381.0Q203 366 203 345V0Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></svg></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"#local\">Vision</a><a href=\"#hardware\">Hardware</a><a href=\"#workflow\">KilnOS</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><button class=\"nav-contact enquiry-open\">Contact</button></nav><button class=\"header-cta register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span class=\"menu-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></header>\n<nav class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Main menu\" hidden><div class=\"menu-links\"><a href=\"#local\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Vision<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span></a><a href=\"#hardware\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Hardware<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span></a><a href=\"#workflow\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>KilnOS<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span></a><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>About<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span></a><button class=\"menu-contact enquiry-open\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Contact<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</span></button></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">Explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></nav>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"intro-runway\">\n<section class=\"section hero\" id=\"top\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"hero-poster\"><h1 class=\"hero-title\" id=\"hero-title\"><span class=\"hero-keep\">Keep the</span> <span class=\"hero-box\"><span class=\"hero-work\">work</span></span> <span class=\"hero-close\">close.</span></h1><figure class=\"hero-device\"><img src=\"/assets/one-proportions.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Kiln One: a satin aluminium local AI workstation with a blue front grille and tilted-square status light\" decoding=\"async\"><img class=\"hero-macro\" src=\"/assets/one-macro-detail-v2.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></figure></div>\n<div class=\"hero-bottom\"><p>Private AI for creative studios.<br>Your brief. Your work. Your approval.</p><div class=\"action-row\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">Explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"intro-caption\"><button class=\"intro-skip\" aria-label=\"Skip the close-up and explore Kiln\">Scroll to explore <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></button></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<section class=\"section local\" id=\"local\" aria-labelledby=\"local-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">01 / The private AI studio</span><span class=\"meta\">Built around your work.</span></div>\n<div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"local-title\">Your studio.<br>In context.</h2><p>Kiln brings your models, client assets and creative workflow into one private workspace. We’re building KilnOS to carry the brief through every revision.</p></div>\n<div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">01 / Project context</span><h3>The brief<br>stays with you.</h3><p>Keep brand rules, approved assets and client feedback connected as the work changes.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">02 / Creative workflow</span><h3>Each revision.<br>In context.</h3><p>Carry the current direction into the next edit, with connected tools and versions to compare.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">03 / Team control</span><h3>Clear access.<br>Named approval.</h3><p>Set project permissions and review what changes before work leaves the studio.</p></article></div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"section workflow\" id=\"workflow\" aria-labelledby=\"workflow-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">02 / The creative process</span><span class=\"meta\">Workflow concept / In development</span></div>\n<div class=\"workflow-layout\"><div class=\"workflow-copy\"><h2 id=\"workflow-title\">Keep the idea<br><span class=\"word-frame\">moving.</span></h2><p>Turn feedback into the next version, without losing the idea that started it.</p></div><div><div class=\"workspace\"><div class=\"workspace-top\"><span class=\"meta\">KilnOS / Launch campaign</span></div><div class=\"work-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Explore a campaign workflow\"><button id=\"work-files\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"work-panel\" data-workflow=\"files\">01 Brief</button><button id=\"work-apps\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"work-panel\" data-workflow=\"apps\" tabindex=\"-1\">02 Revise</button><button id=\"work-flows\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"work-panel\" data-workflow=\"flows\" tabindex=\"-1\">03 Deliver</button></div><div class=\"work-panel\" id=\"work-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"work-files\"><h3 id=\"work-quote\">“Pick up the<br>campaign.”</h3><p id=\"work-note\">Start with the brief, brand assets and latest client feedback, ready to work from.</p></div><div class=\"workspace-files\" id=\"workspace-files\"><span>Creative brief</span><span>Brand assets</span><span>Client feedback</span></div></div></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section studio-service\" id=\"studio-service\" aria-labelledby=\"service-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">03 / A studio system</span><span class=\"meta\">Proposed ownership and service</span></div>\n<div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"service-title\">Your compute.<br>A working studio.</h2><p>The value is in the work around the model. A setup shaped to your projects, with a service to help keep it working.</p></div>\n<div class=\"service-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">Owned hardware + core experience</span><h3>A home for<br>your work.</h3><p>Local capacity for your models and projects. A shared workspace on hardware your studio owns.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">Optional managed KilnOS</span><h3>Help with<br>the upkeep.</h3><p>Workflow setup, qualified model updates and scoped support. Built around the tools and working practices your team uses.</p></article></div>\n<p class=\"service-boundary\">KilnOS and managed services are in development. Explore our proposed software plans below; pilot conversations will confirm scope and measures of success.</p>\n<a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#questions\">What makes Kiln different <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section local software-pricing\" id=\"software-pricing\" aria-labelledby=\"software-pricing-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">Managed KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">Proposed software plans</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"software-pricing-title\">Software for<br>the people creating.</h2><p>Shared projects, approvals, qualified updates and standard support. Priced for the creators using your studio’s hardware.</p></div><div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">Kiln One</span><h3>£99<br>per creator / month</h3><p>10-creator minimum.<br><strong>£11,880 per year minimum.</strong><br>Billed annually, ex VAT.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/one#software-pricing\">Explore the plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article><article><span class=\"meta\">Kiln Atelier</span><h3>£89<br>per creator / month</h3><p>30-creator minimum.<br><strong>£32,040 per year minimum.</strong><br>Billed annually, ex VAT.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/atelier#software-pricing\">Explore the plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article><article><span class=\"meta\">Atelier Rack</span><h3>£79<br>per creator / month</h3><p>120-creator minimum.<br><strong>£113,760 per year minimum.</strong><br>Billed annually, ex VAT.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/rack#software-pricing\">Explore the plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article></div><p class=\"service-boundary\">Proposed launch pricing, billed annually, excluding VAT. Hardware is purchased separately. Review-only seats are free; creation and agent actions require paid creator seats. Cloud usage, custom integrations and enhanced service levels are quoted separately. Seat counts do not guarantee simultaneous workload performance.</p></section>\n<section class=\"section hardware\" id=\"hardware\" data-product=\"one\" aria-labelledby=\"hardware-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">04 / The hardware</span><span class=\"meta\">A physical home for your AI.</span></div>\n<div class=\"hardware-heading\"><h2 id=\"hardware-title\">Choose your<br>capacity.</h2><div class=\"product-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Choose Kiln hardware\"><button id=\"tab-one\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"product-one\" data-product=\"one\">Kiln One</button><button id=\"tab-atelier\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"product-atelier\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-product=\"atelier\">Atelier</button><button id=\"tab-rack\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"product-rack\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-product=\"rack\">Atelier Rack</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"product-carousel\" aria-label=\"Kiln hardware\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\"><div class=\"product-slide\" id=\"product-one\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-one\" data-product-slide=\"one\"><div class=\"product-stage\"><div class=\"product-copy\"><p class=\"meta\">Kiln One</p><p class=\"product-tagline\">Your studio.<br>Your compute.</p></div><figure class=\"product-figure\"><img src=\"/assets/one-interior-yellow-cutout.webp\" width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Kiln One with a yellow grille and exposed internal components\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></figure><h3 class=\"product-name\">One.</h3></div><div class=\"product-bottom\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">From £19,900</p><span class=\"product-price-note\">1 GPU / ex VAT</span></div><p class=\"product-description\">Your own AI models. Your private projects. Shared from one compact workstation.</p><div class=\"product-actions\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/one\">Explore Kiln One <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button class=\"text-link compare-open\">Compare configurations <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"product-slide\" id=\"product-atelier\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-atelier\" data-product-slide=\"atelier\"><div class=\"product-stage\"><div class=\"product-copy\"><p class=\"meta\">Kiln Atelier</p><p class=\"product-tagline\">More capacity.<br>Same control.</p></div><figure class=\"product-figure\"><img src=\"/assets/atelier-interior-red-cutout.webp\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Kiln Atelier with a red grille and exposed internal components\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></figure><h3 class=\"product-name\">Atelier.</h3></div><div class=\"product-bottom\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">Request a quote</p><span class=\"product-price-note\">2 or 4 GPUs / hardware</span></div><p class=\"product-description\">Rack-ready compute for demanding creative work. More models, more capacity, in your studio.</p><div class=\"product-actions\"><button class=\"action primary enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln Atelier\">Request a quote <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/atelier\">Explore Kiln Atelier <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button class=\"text-link compare-open\">Compare configurations <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"product-slide\" id=\"product-rack\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-rack\" data-product-slide=\"rack\"><div class=\"product-stage\"><div class=\"product-copy\"><p class=\"meta\">Kiln Atelier Rack</p><p class=\"product-tagline\">Room for<br>what comes next.</p></div><figure class=\"product-figure\"><img src=\"/assets/atelier-rack-unibody-v8-1254.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/atelier-rack-unibody-v8-768.webp 768w,/assets/atelier-rack-unibody-v8-1254.webp 1254w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 55vw\" width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Four Kiln Ateliers in a seamless satin aluminium rack with curved upper corners and precision disc casters\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></figure><h3 class=\"product-name\">Atelier Rack.</h3></div><div class=\"product-bottom\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">Request a quote</p><span class=\"product-price-note\">4 Ateliers / 8–16 GPUs</span></div><p class=\"product-description\">Four Ateliers. One modular rack. Grow your studio’s private compute as the work grows.</p><div class=\"product-actions\"><button class=\"action primary enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln Atelier Rack\">Request a quote <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/rack\">Explore Kiln Atelier Rack <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button class=\"text-link compare-open\">Compare configurations <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"carousel-controls\"><span class=\"meta carousel-hint\">Swipe to explore</span><span class=\"carousel-count\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">01 / 03</span><button class=\"carousel-prev\" aria-label=\"Previous hardware\" disabled>←</button><button class=\"carousel-next\" aria-label=\"Next hardware\">→</button></div>\n\n</section>\n<figure class=\"studio-photo\" id=\"studio\"><img src=\"/assets/atelier-rack-unibody-black-v8-1536.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/atelier-rack-unibody-black-v8-768.webp 768w,/assets/atelier-rack-unibody-black-v8-1536.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"100vw\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Kiln Atelier Rack concept with a seamless satin aluminium frame, curved upper corners and precision disc casters, photographed against black\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure>\n\n<section class=\"section privacy\" id=\"privacy\" aria-labelledby=\"privacy-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">05 / The boundary matters</span><span class=\"meta\">Local by design.</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"privacy-title\" id=\"privacy-title\"><span class=\"privacy-first\">What stays</span> <span class=\"privacy-inside\">inside.</span> <span class=\"privacy-tail\">The work that matters.</span></h2>\n<div class=\"privacy-grid\"><article><h3>Client work.</h3><p>Briefs and unreleased ideas. Kept close.</p></article><article><h3>Studio knowledge.</h3><p>Contracts and accounts. Under your control.</p></article><article><h3>Creative iterations.</h3><p>Prompts and drafts. Designed to stay local.</p></article></div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"section network-thesis\" id=\"network\" data-network-thesis data-network-state=\"reserve\" aria-labelledby=\"network-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">06 / The network thesis</span><span class=\"meta\">Future direction / Opt-in</span></div>\n<div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"network-title\">Studio first.<br>Network next.</h2><div><p>The next creative network could grow from compute studios already own.</p><p>Owners could earn from spare capacity. Creators could access KilnOS without buying hardware.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"network-model\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Explore the proposed capacity-sharing model\">\n<div class=\"network-model-head\"><p class=\"network-state\"><span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span data-network-status aria-live=\"polite\">Set aside what your studio needs.</span></p><span class=\"meta\">Illustrative capacity</span></div>\n<div class=\"network-controls\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose a capacity scenario\"><button type=\"button\" data-network-step=\"reserve\" aria-pressed=\"true\">01 Reserve</button><button type=\"button\" data-network-step=\"share\" aria-pressed=\"false\">02 Share</button><button type=\"button\" data-network-step=\"reclaim\" aria-pressed=\"false\">03 Reclaim</button></div><div class=\"network-capacity\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"network-legend\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span><i></i>Your studio</span><span class=\"network-available\"><i></i><span data-network-label>Available capacity</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"network-steps\">\n<article class=\"network-step\" data-network-copy=\"reserve\"><span class=\"meta\">01 / Reserve</span><strong>Keep what you need.</strong><span class=\"network-step-copy\">Set when your Kiln is available and how much capacity you choose to share.</span></article>\n<article class=\"network-step\" data-network-copy=\"share\"><span class=\"meta\">02 / Share</span><strong>Put spare hours to work.</strong><span class=\"network-step-copy\">Eligible paid jobs could run on participating machines, earning income for their owners.</span></article>\n<article class=\"network-step\" data-network-copy=\"reclaim\"><span class=\"meta\">03 / Reclaim</span><strong>Your studio comes first.</strong><span class=\"network-step-copy\">The goal is to pause or move network jobs when your own work needs the capacity.</span></article>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"network-note\"><strong>A future direction, built on choice.</strong> Participation would be optional. Workload isolation, studio priority, reclaim time and the economics are still to be validated.</p>\n</section>\n<figure class=\"hardware-interlude\" id=\"atelier-reveal\" data-hardware-reveal aria-labelledby=\"hardware-interlude-caption\">\n<div class=\"reveal-scene\"><div class=\"reveal-camera\">\n<img class=\"reveal-closed\" src=\"/assets/atelier-dark-clean-v2.webp\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Close-up of the Kiln Atelier black concept, showing the aluminium front edge, grille and illuminated tilted-square status light.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<span class=\"reveal-status\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"reveal-light reveal-light-red\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"reveal-light reveal-light-yellow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"reveal-light reveal-light-blue\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n</div></div>\n<figcaption id=\"hardware-interlude-caption\"><p><span class=\"reveal-line\">A place for</span><span class=\"reveal-line\">your ideas.</span></p></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"section faq\" id=\"questions\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">07 / A closer look</span></div>\n<div class=\"faq-layout\"><div><h2 id=\"faq-title\">Clear on<br>the details.</h2></div><div>\n<details><summary>Why choose Kiln over a GPU workstation?</summary><p>A GPU workstation gives your team local capacity and the freedom to assemble its own tools. Kiln is being built to bring that capacity into a shared creative workflow, with project context, version history and approval steps. The proposed managed service adds setup, qualified updates and scoped support. Pilots will test the time saved and quality of the work.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Does every task stay local?</summary><p>Local workflows are designed to keep models, prompts, source files and generated drafts on Kiln and authorised team devices. Optional external tools require project approval. Company sign-in and software updates may still need internet access.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Can we use our own models?</summary><p>The plan is a studio-managed model collection. Choices depend on model licensing, compatibility and available memory. The first collection is being qualified for creative directions, image storyboards and revision.</p></details>\n<details><summary>What does £19,900 include?</summary><p>Our proposed Kiln One hardware price includes one NVIDIA RTX PRO 5000 Blackwell 72 GB GPU, 128 GB system memory and 4 TB storage. Choose two GPUs for £31,900. Prices exclude VAT; managed KilnOS, optional cloud use and separately scoped services are additional. Final specifications and quotes will be confirmed before ordering.</p></details><details><summary>What does a GPU upgrade add?</summary><p>One goes from one to two GPUs; Atelier goes from two to four. Extra GPUs give compatible workflows more capacity for parallel jobs and larger models. They do not automatically double speed or the number of active users. One’s second GPU adds £12,000 when ordering. Atelier configurations and later upgrades are quoted individually.</p></details>\n<details><summary>How is software priced?</summary><p>Managed KilnOS is proposed at £99 per creator/month for One (10-seat minimum, £11,880 per year), £89 for Atelier (30-seat minimum, £32,040 per year), and £79 for Rack (120-seat minimum, £113,760 per year). Plans are billed annually and exclude VAT. Hardware, external cloud usage and custom services are additional. Review-only seats are free.</p></details><details><summary>Does a GPU upgrade change our subscription?</summary><p>Adding a GPU does not change the per-creator rate for your product. Subscription charges follow your paid creator seats, subject to the plan minimum. More GPUs provide workload capacity; they do not guarantee that every licensed user can run demanding jobs at once.</p></details>\n<details><summary>When can I order Kiln?</summary><p>Register interest for product news and launch details. Orders are not open yet, and no payment or commitment is required.</p></details><details><summary>How do we discuss a pilot or investment?</summary><p>Use Contact and choose Studio pilot or Investment enquiry. Pilots are being developed through direct conversations with studios; joining the interest list is not an application for a pilot.</p></details>\n</div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section pilot\" id=\"interest\" aria-labelledby=\"interest-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">08 / Stay close to Kiln</span></div><h2 class=\"pilot-title\" id=\"interest-title\">Be first<span>to know.</span></h2><div class=\"pilot-bottom\"><p class=\"lead\">A closer look at your future studio.<br>Product progress and launch news.</p><div><button class=\"action primary register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">Explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"fine\">No payment or commitment. <a href=\"/privacy\">Privacy details</a></p></div></div></section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-semibold-paper.svg\" width=\"135\" height=\"46\" alt=\"kiln\"></a><p>Independent thinking.<br>Local compute.</p><nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/about\">About Kiln</a><a href=\"#hardware\">The hardware</a><a href=\"#network\">Our network thesis</a><a href=\"#questions\">Questions</a><a href=\"#privacy\">Our privacy direction</a><a href=\"/privacy\">Website privacy</a><button class=\"footer-contact enquiry-open\">Contact us ↗</button></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© Kiln 2026 / Porto Labs</span><span>Hardware and software in development.</span><a href=\"#top\">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer>\n<button class=\"mobile-dock register-open\">Register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<dialog id=\"register-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"register-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close registration\">×</button><span class=\"meta\">Stay close to Kiln</span><h2 id=\"register-title\">Be first<br>to know.</h2><p>Product news, launch details and a closer look at creative work in KilnOS.</p><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xjgepgbg\" met